    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d600">

                <pb facs="0767" n="693" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg693"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.85/145</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d600-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-13T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 13, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your cipher telegram September 10, 8 p.m.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d600-f2"/> The
                    Department has agreed with the British Government to the following scheme of
                    allocation of the German and Austrian vessels in China: [Here follows the latter
                    half of the British Embassy’s memorandum of October 1.<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d600-f3"/>] Consult with your British colleague and endeavor to
                    secure this arrangement. For your guidance the Department is opposed to the
                    recognition of the claims of any private parties that they have purchased <pb
                        facs="0768" n="694" xml:id="pg694"/> any of these vessels. You will endeavor
                    to prevent recognition of such claims.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
